<p>To use Thawani you need a Thawani merchant account and its API keys (Merchant portal → Developers). <a href="https://www.s4d.om/g/c" target="_blank" rel="noopener">How to get the API keys</a>.</p>
<p>Testing keys are in the <a href="https://developer.thawani.om/#introduction" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Thawani Checkout API documentation</a>.</p>
<p class="inline-alert inline-alert--error">Thawani only accepts Omani Rial. If your store uses another currency, set the <b>Exchange Rate</b> from your currency to OMR (for example 0.385 for USD).</p>
